msgid ""
"<p>Using an dynamic IP address causes this device to get a free IP address "
"automatically.</p>\n"
"<p>The interface will try to contact an DHCP- or BOOTP-Server during the "
"boot process.</p>\n"
"<p>Rendevouz is not supported yet.</p>"
